[
  {
    "id": "1234734",
    "original": "今は本読んでる方が楽しいな。基本的にずっと本読みの部類ではあったけど、読まない時期はあんまり読まないんだよね。今はまたたくさん読む波が来ている感じかな。",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "1487853",
        "text": "I think I'll have more fun reading something now. I was always part of the bookworm group, but there are times when I just don't feel like reading anything. Right now I'm getting lots of \"Read! Read!\" waves coming at me."
